<title>UK: Boustead to take 1.6 mln stg charge on sale.</title>
<headline>Boustead to take 1.6 mln stg charge on sale.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automobile components firm Boustead Plc said on Monday it would incorporate a loss of 1.6 million stg in its accounts for the year to March 1997 on the sale of its stake in Magpie Engineering and Bearings Ltd to Fenner Plc.</p>
<p>Boustead said it was selling its shareholding in Magpie Engineering through its subsidiary Boustead Industries Ltd for 2.21 million stg which would include settlement of inter-company loans and debt.</p>
<p>A distributor of bearings and power transmission products, Magpie had net assets of 1.17 million stg including net debt of 2.7 million stg as on March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
